Description: AD Launcher — The Art of Minecraft (Dark Baroque Edition)
 Native Linux GTK4 Minecraft launcher featuring high-performance
 Mesa OpenGL multi-threading, Caravaggio Chiaroscuro aesthetic,
 universal instance importer, mod & shader archive, and multiplayer discovery.
